------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Method:      setData
--
-- Description: Initialise selection table choice in create mode
--
-- Method Type: Function/Procedure
-- Arguments:
--   [#] [R/RW] [Data Type] [Description]
--    1   R      STRING      Type of design element to be created
--    2   R      DBREF       Scope for table search (TABGRO or SPWL)
